<title>GERMANY: MOTOR RACING-GERMAN GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-GERMAN GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>HOCKENHEIM, Germany 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grid positions for</p>
